{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/about_this_game.png?t=1749482805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a flip coin game with the devil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can keep all the coins you flipped in your pocket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But nothing comes for free; you'll need to pay the debt in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Otherwise, some bad things could happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you fill your pocket full before you run out of luck?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/flip_coins.gif?t=1749482805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/the_generosity_of_the_devil.png?t=1749482805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have bad luck? Worry not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of the round, the devil is kind enough to provide one item for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The item can be used to improve your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And if you have more to spare, you can buy them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to utilize them to build a strategy to maximize your profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/devil_offers.gif?t=1749482805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/item_upgrade.png?t=1749482805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the money you gain from the game to upgrade the items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More upgrades, more profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At some point, you might find yourself not needing any luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can just craft your own victory by hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The snowball will get bigger and bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/upgrade.gif?t=1749482805\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/and_there_is_more.png?t=1749482805\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft you own items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill the devil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock relics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/extras/other.gif?t=1749482805\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3468920?t=1749482805","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3468920?t=1749482805","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/25a858d189eedce48df83944d5ba6aa441bdaf63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749482805","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468920/25a858d189eedce48df83944d5ba6aa441bdaf63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749482805","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The content of the game will show the player's blood splash in the form of a trade with the demon.\r\nPlayers might discover that the item's description contains a slight sexual innuendo.\r\nPlayers may find that the icons and descriptions of